      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory RTO Paperwork, Transit Marine Insurance &amp; Delivery Handover for Bike Transportation Sardarshahar Secure</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Planning to move your two-wheeler to or from Sardarshahar requires meticulous preparation to ensure a seamless and secure journey. While the physical condition of your bike is paramount, the administrative groundwork often dictates the smoothness of the entire relocation process.</p>
<p>Neglecting essential paperwork can lead to significant delays, unexpected disputes, or even the refusal of service by professional transporters. To safeguard your investment and ensure compliance with local and national transport regulations, you must assemble a specific set of documents before handing over your vehicle for transit.</p>

<h3>Essential Documentation Checklist</h3>
<p>Before your bike is loaded onto the transport carrier, verify that the following core documents are present and easily accessible. These papers serve as the legal backbone of the transaction, proving ownership and roadworthiness.</p>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Self-Attested RC Photocopy:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">You must provide a clear, self-attested photocopy of the Registered Certificate (RC). This document verifies your legal ownership of the vehicle. Ensure that the name on the RC matches the identity proof provided to the logistics company to avoid any verification hurdles during the pickup or delivery phase.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Current PUC Certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A valid Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate is mandatory. This certifies that your bike meets the current environmental emission standards. An expired PUC can result in the transporter refusing to load the vehicle, as it implies the vehicle is not legally roadworthy for public transport transfer.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Valid Insurance Certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Your existing third-party or comprehensive insurance policy must be active and valid. While the transporter provides cargo insurance, your personal policy serves as an additional layer of protection and is often required for the final handover process if the bike is to be driven out of the facility immediately.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA-Approved Consignment Bilty:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">This is the most critical document for the transit phase. The IBA (Indian Biennial Agreement) approved consignment bilty acts as the official receipt and contract between you and the logistics provider. It details the pick-up and drop-off locations, the current condition of the bike, and the agreed-upon terms of service.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>Both parties sign this document, making it the primary evidence in case of any discrepancies</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
</div>
<h3>The Value of Marine Transit Insurance</h3>
<p>Beyond the standard paperwork, the financial security of your vehicle during transit is equally vital. Reputable bike transportation services offer <strong>100% declared-value marine transit insurance</strong>. This specialized coverage is designed to protect your bike against damage, theft, or total loss while it is in the custody of the transporter.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Unlike basic transit covers that may have significant deductibles or caps on claim amounts, 100% declared-value insurance ensures that you are reimbursed the full market value you declared at the time of booking.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This comprehensive protection is essential for peace of mind, guaranteeing that any unforeseen incidents on the road to Sardarshahar do not result in a financial burden for the owner.</span></li></ul></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


